Package: deepin-terminal-ghostty
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Deepin terminal emulator based on Ghostty
 deepin-terminal-ghostty is a Linux terminal emulator built with
 C++20, Qt6 Widgets, DTK6, and libghostty-vt.
 .
 It provides a tabbed terminal interface with deepin-style UI
 integration. This single package ships the application binary
 together with the bundled libqtghostty runtime and the Ghostty
 VT engine; no separate library or development package is produced.
